# Two 2-day backfills of the quake_lake DAG, without and with --max-active-runs (S10, 2026-11-24 UTC).
# On the compose stack after airflow-s10.json's measurement, with commit e8d994c's DAG:
#   docker compose run --rm airflow-cli backfill create --dag-id quake_lake --from-date 2026-11-13 --to-date 2026-11-14
#   docker compose run --rm airflow-cli backfill create --dag-id quake_lake --from-date 2026-11-11 --to-date 2026-11-12 --max-active-runs 1
# Run times from the REST API (dagRuns), task lines from each task's attempt-1 log (taskInstances/<task>/logs/1).

